{"id":"pound","name":"Pound","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:pound"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Pound","text":"(1.) A weight. Heb. maneh, equal to 100 shekels (1 Kings 10:17; Ezra 2:69; Neh. 7:71, 72). Gr. litra, equal to about 12 oz. avoirdupois (John 12:3; 19:39). (2.) A sum of money; the Gr. mna or mina (Luke 19:13, 16, 18, 20, 24, 25). It was equal to 100 drachmas, and was of the value of about $3, 6s. 8d. of our money. (See MONEY.)"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"G3414","lemma":"μνᾶ","xlit":"mnâ","gloss":"a mna , a certain weight","kjv":"pound","count":6,"share":0.33},{"strong":"G1176","lemma":"δέκα","xlit":"déka","gloss":"","kjv":"een, ten","count":5,"share":0.28},{"strong":"H4488","lemma":"מָנֶה","xlit":"mâneh","gloss":"a fixed weight or measured amount","kjv":"maneh, pound","count":4,"share":0.22},{"strong":"H1871","lemma":"דַּרְכְּמוֹן","xlit":"darkᵉmôwn","gloss":"a 'drachma', or coin","kjv":"dram","count":3,"share":0.17},{"strong":"G1401","lemma":"δοῦλος","xlit":"doûlos","gloss":"a slave","kjv":"bond, servant","count":4,"share":0.22},{"strong":"G840","lemma":"αὐστηρός","xlit":"austērós","gloss":"rough","kjv":"austere","count":2,"share":0.11}],"verses":["Luke.19.13","Luke.19.16","Luke.19.18","Luke.19.20","Luke.19.24","Luke.19.25","1Kgs.10.17","Ezra.2.69","Neh.7.71","Neh.7.72","Luke.19.14","Luke.19.15","Luke.19.17","Luke.19.19","Luke.19.21","Luke.19.22","Luke.19.23","John.12.3"],"related":[{"id":"measure","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"weights","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"trustee","type":"cooccur","shared":13,"jaccard":0.265,"why":"13 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"steward","type":"cooccur","shared":13,"jaccard":0.22,"why":"13 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"probation","type":"cooccur","shared":13,"jaccard":0.176,"why":"13 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"dram","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.1